{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31929","headline":"雪晴晚望 · 贾岛","name":"雪晴晚望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"倚杖望晴雪，溪云几万重。\n樵人归白屋，寒日下危峯。\n野火烧冈草，断烟生石松。\n却回山寺路，闻打暮天钟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_31929.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_31929","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《瀛奎律髓》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/瀛奎律髓_(四庫全書本)）"}